{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"ad1fe52fcbd11e07","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n\tparticipant User\n    participant Orchestrator\n    participant RAG\n    participant External_RAG as \"External RAG (FMO)\"\n    participant LLM\n    participant Embedding_Store as \"Embedding Store\"\n    participant Embedding\n    participant Id_Generation as \"Id Generation\"\n    participant Output_Mongo as \"Output Mongo Store\"\n\n    User->>Orchestrator: Unstructured I/P (pdf / csv / txt)\n    Orchestrator->>Embedding: Step 1: Embedding on input file\n    Embedding->>Embedding_Store: Step 2: Store to vector db\n    Embedding_Store->>Orchestrator: Step 3: Embedding status: Successful\n    Orchestrator->>Embedding_Store: Step 4: Pick 1st chunk (LLM CALL FOR QUERY GENERATION) + Relevant top k chunks\n    Embedding_Store->>Orchestrator: Step 5: Return the content\n    Orchestrator ->>LLM: Step 6: LLM inference based on content types\n    LLM->>Orchestrator: Step 7: Parse the LLM output\n    Orchestrator->>Id_Generation: Step 8: Generates Ids accordingly based on the content type\n    Id_Generation->>Output_Mongo: Step 9: Store them WITH EMBEDDINGS (cytoscape schema)\n\n```","x":4128,"y":800,"width":2672,"height":720},
		{"id":"0aef96b836c7b395","type":"text","text":"``` mermaid\n\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as File Arrival (Blob / Airbyte / UI)\n    participant Pre as Pre-Processor\n    participant Chunk as Chunker\n    participant RAGBase as Base RAG (Metadata + IDs)\n    participant RAGFile as File RAG (Incoming Chunks)\n    participant LLM as LLM Inference\n    participant ID as Deterministic ID Processor\n    participant Val as Validator / Human-in-Loop\n    participant Cat as Catalog / Registry\n\n    User ->> Pre: New file detected\n    Pre ->> Pre: Identify file type (DDL, SQL, PDF, Metadata, etc.)\n    Pre ->> Pre: Determine source + domain\n    Pre ->> Chunk: Decide chunking strategy (chunk type + size)\n    Chunk ->> RAGFile: Store file chunks for lookup\n    \n    Pre ->> RAGBase: Retrieve related base metadata context\n    Pre ->> RAGFile: Retrieve file chunk context\n    Pre ->> LLM: Send dual RAG context (Base + File chunks)\n\n    LLM ->> LLM: Infer structured JSON output\n    LLM ->> ID: Send inference results\n\n    ID ->> RAGBase: Check existing entities by ID\n    alt Existing entity\n        ID ->> RAGBase: Update metadata with same ID\n    else New entity\n        ID ->> RAGBase: Generate new ID & insert\n    end\n\n    ID ->> Val: Validate consistency (conflict/ambiguity check)\n    alt Validation passed\n        Val ->> Cat: Register / update catalog\n    else Conflict or ambiguity\n        Val ->> Human: Escalate for manual approval\n        Human ->> Cat: Approve & update catalog\n    end\n\n    Cat ->> [User]: File successfully processed & metadata updated\n\n```","x":-1600,"y":-80,"width":3180,"height":1430},
		{"id":"3be78466f15be9ea","type":"text","text":"Blockers :\n\n0. Input file\n1. Content Type.\n2. Chunking strategy?\n3. LLM Input - ? \n4. LLM Output - ? ","x":4128,"y":1658,"width":442,"height":251},
		{"id":"b5772e5434c12e22","type":"text","text":"Initial Assumptions :\n\n1. File type - txt or pdf\n2. Content type - \n    2.1 KPI\n    2.2 Metadata\n\t\t- Text \n        - Code   - (DDL's and ER diagram)\n    2.3 Business Glossary\n3. Chunking Strategy - Since it is text we will use \n        chunk size - 500 \n        chunk overlap - 60 \n4. LLM Prompts - \n    Metadata\n    KPI \n    Business Glossary\n5. LLM Output - \n    Metadata (cytoscape schema)\n    KPI (In house schema)\n    Business Glossary ( Summary ) \n    \n","x":4880,"y":1658,"width":500,"height":560},
		{"id":"ef847479cdee214e","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram  \n    participant User  \n    participant Orch as Orchestrator  \n    participant RAG as RAG  \n    participant ExtRAG as External RAG (FMO)  \n    participant LLM as LLM  \n    participant Store as Store\n\n    User->>Orch: Submit Unstructured I/P  \n    Orch->>RAG: Process Internal RAG  \n    RAG->>Orch: Return RAG Results  \n    Orch->>ExtRAG: Query External RAG (FMO)  \n    ExtRAG->>Orch: Return External Results  \n    Orch->>LLM: Send Combined Context  \n    LLM->>Orch: Generate Response  \n    Orch->>Store: Store Results/Logs  \n    Store->>Orch: Confirm Storage  \n    Orch->>User: Return Final Response\n```","x":2080,"y":-80,"width":1349,"height":732},
		{"id":"256ab58c5edc5f0a","type":"text","text":"1st Iteration :\n\nWe will be heading with the initial assumptions \nand we will target metadata pdf as \nunstructured Input by the user","x":5680,"y":1658,"width":342,"height":189}
	],
	"edges":[]
